    "isEquipped": false,
    "description": "Call on your wyvern to bathe all units in a forward cone in drakefire.&nbsp;<span style=\"color: var(--color-light-2);\">Affected units must succeed an Agi saving throw (DC 15), or suffer 3d8 + Tqn Fire damage and 2 Brk. On a successful save, units are only dealt 1d8 + Tqn Fire damage and no Brk damage.&nbsp;</span><div style=\"\"><br></div><div style=\"\">Leaves behind Fire Tiles on affected squares for 1 round.<br><div style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: var(--color-light-2);\"><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: var(--color-light-2);\">Gain another use of this ability at Level 20, and again at Level 25.</span></div></div></div>",
